stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> Uploaded

    Uploaded: P1 Upload - one txt file, or a zip holding one, plus five portal controls
    ErrorFile: Error file returned - schema undocumented
    Validated: P2 Validated
    Statement: P3 Return statement generated
    Approved: P4 Approved - can never be cancelled
    RejectedByEmployer: P4 Rejected by the employer at statement review
    DDBS: P5 Due Deposit Balance Summary - interest auto-calculated
    Challan: P6 Challan with TRRN - treated as payment initiated
    Paid: P7 Paid
    Receipt: P8 Receipt downloaded
    Supplementary: Supplementary return - repeatable
    Revised: Revised return - overwrites the portal data

    Uploaded --> Validated: validations pass
    Uploaded --> ErrorFile: validations fail
    ErrorFile --> Uploaded: fix at source and upload again
    Validated --> Statement
    Statement --> Approved: employer approves
    Statement --> RejectedByEmployer: employer rejects
    RejectedByEmployer --> Uploaded: new upload
    Approved --> DDBS
    DDBS --> Challan: one or more challans
    Challan --> Paid
    Paid --> Receipt
    Receipt --> [*]

    Approved --> Revised: no other return in process and no payment initiated
    Approved --> Supplementary: only members absent from every prior return
    Receipt --> Supplementary: new members for the month, after payment
    Revised --> Uploaded
    Supplementary --> Uploaded

    note right of Challan
        From here a Revised return is barred
        so a downward correction is no longer possible
        a Supplementary for absent members stays open
    end note
